Shared reduction tree
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  omit-prime             -> direct witness t=1/p         | state=small-prime cover profile; status=done
  remove-large           -> descend to smaller LRC seed  | state=safe-set measure + component/arc budget; status=HYP-2904/S31v/S31w
  multi-large r<=6       -> union-bound survival         | state=core floor + arc budget; status=S31v
  multi-large r>=7       -> second moment                | state=divisibility/resonant-pair graph; status=open
  bounded covering core  -> finite extremality           | state=three-gap/AP-GW + depth-parity packets; status=open Node 2

