Flush-out target
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The LRC14 proof should now be stated as boundary-state induction:
  (1) descend all unbounded/non-covering rows by omit-prime and remove-large;
  (2) close r>=7 by a resonant-pair/divisibility second-moment ledger;
  (3) close the bounded covering core by AP/GW tight-locus rigidity plus
      missing-depth parity packets, not by raw runner deletion or scalar minors.
